= New faces in the party

Our recent electoral alliance in the form of [? if jxsi_formed and not jxsi_dissolved: jxsi?][?if jxcat_formed: jxcat?] has seen an influx of personalities walking into the party to become part of this huge project. A huge name among them is that of Carme Forcadell, former ANC President and big promoter of the idea of National Unity towards independence.

- @no_romeva: Welcome to the party!
- @raul_romeva_disp: And not only her!

@no_romeva
view-if: jxsi_formation_num = 50 or jxcat_formation_num = 50
go-to: post_event

@raul_romeva_disp
view-if: not jxsi_formation_num = 50 and not jxcat_formation_num = 50
on-arrival: {!
    Q.raul_romeva_advisor_available = 1
!}
face-image: img/erc/romeva.jpg

Along with her, Raül Romeva is also joining in. 

He who will be the number one on the united list, without actually being the presidential candidate, leaves ICV-EUiA behind and joins the ranks.

- @post_event: Welcome both!
